  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evidence and Analysis for governance &amp; conflict policy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme aims to support more evidence-based policymaking by international development actors and developing country policymakers on advancing democracy, reducing violence, stabilising fragile states, and strengthening governance in developing countries.  Carnegie will do this by undertaking high-quality and policy-oriented research and influencing policymakers including non-traditional stakeholders as well as traditional donors, non-governmental organisations, and the governments of developing countries.</narrative>
  </description>
